  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "This recipe will make about 6 cups of smoothie. Work in batches to best fit your blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry the fresh produce."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel and thinly slice bananas; set aside."
    },
    {
      "text": "Zest and juice lime into a blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add frozen mixed berries, yogurt, milk, honey, and cinnamon to the blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend on high speed until smooth, 1-2 minutes."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide smoothie between bowls and top with banana, blackberries, and granola. Enjoy!"
    }
